  "scenario": "request-id-exhausted",
  "title": "请求序号耗尽",
  "content_samples": {},
  "description": "request_sequence=999999 时最后一个请求仍生成 req_999999；随后序号耗尽必须返回 503 REQUEST_ID_EXHAUSTED 且 request_id=null，绝不生成七位标识或改变协议状态。",
